 <h2>What we remember</h2>
 <p>Choose “Remember my details on this device” to save your name, phone number, email if supplied, and selected delivery address when you order. Label addresses Home, Work or a custom name, and choose a default. Always check your details before ordering.</p>
 <h2>How long we remember</h2>
 <p>Your saved details expire 180 days after your latest successful order on this browser. Each new order starts a fresh 180 day period. Browsing, edits and unsuccessful orders do not extend it. Expired details become unavailable and are removed during cleanup.</p>
 <h2>Your browser and your privacy</h2>
 <p>Your details stay in this website’s private database. A cookie holds only a random access key. Saved details are limited to this business and do not include payment card details.</p>
 <p>Anyone sharing this browser profile may see your saved details. Use a device you trust. Another browser or device will not have access. Clearing cookies or using private browsing may stop us recognising you.</p>
 <h2>You stay in control</h2>
 <p>Choose “Use another address” to add an address. Edits are saved with your next order when remembering is enabled. “Remove address” deletes one address. “Forget my details” removes this browser’s saved details and access cookie. That control is available in checkout and below.</p>
